{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hant",
  "strings": {
    "%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 已恢復自動鎖定與解鎖": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ resumed automatic lock and unlock"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已恢復自動鎖定與解鎖"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 已暫停自動鎖定與解鎖": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ paused automatic lock and unlock"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已暫停自動鎖定與解鎖"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 已自動鎖定：你離開了": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ locked automatically because you left"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已自動鎖定：你離開了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 已鎖定": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ is locked"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 已鎖定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 小時": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 Hour"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 小時"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "15 分鐘": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "15 Minutes"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "15 分鐘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "4 小時": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4 Hours"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4 小時"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac 因為你離開而自動鎖定、或你不在附近時被手動解鎖，會發通知給你。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You'll be notified when your Mac locks because you left, or when it's unlocked manually while you're away."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 因為你離開而自動鎖定、或你不在附近時被手動解鎖，會發通知給你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac 已鎖定": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac Locked"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 已鎖定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac 狀態": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac Status"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 狀態"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Presence Remote": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presence Remote"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presence Remote"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Presence Remote 透過藍牙連到 Mac 上的 Presence，指令都經過加密。Apple Watch 會透過這支 iPhone 取得配對。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presence Remote connects to Presence on your Mac over Bluetooth, and every command is encrypted. Your Apple Watch gets the pairing from this iPhone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presence Remote 透過藍牙連到 Mac 上的 Presence，指令都經過加密。Apple Watch 會透過這支 iPhone 取得配對。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Works with the free Presence for Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Works with the free Presence for Mac"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Works with the free Presence for Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上一頁": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Previous Slide"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上一頁"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下一頁": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Next Slide"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下一頁"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "之後要重新掃描 QR code 才能再控制這台 Mac。Apple Watch 也會一起取消。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You'll need to scan the QR code again to control this Mac. Your Apple Watch will be unpaired too."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "之後要重新掃描 QR code 才能再控制這台 Mac。Apple Watch 也會一起取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "也可以對 Siri 說「用 Presence Remote 鎖定電腦」，或把「鎖定 Mac」加到動作按鈕、控制中心或「捷徑」。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can also say “Lock computer with Presence Remote” to Siri, or add Lock Mac to the Action button, Control Center, or Shortcuts."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "也可以對 Siri 說「用 Presence Remote 鎖定電腦」，或把「鎖定 Mac」加到動作按鈕、控制中心或「捷徑」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你不在附近時，%@ 被手動解鎖了": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ was unlocked manually while you were away"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你不在附近時，%@ 被手動解鎖了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "分鐘": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Minutes"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分鐘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取得 Mac 狀態": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Get Mac Status"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "取得 Mac 狀態"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取消配對": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unpair"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "取消配對"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "名稱": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Name"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名稱"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "回傳 Presence 目前的狀態，例如「Weichung 在附近」。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Returns the current status of Presence, such as “iPhone nearby”."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "回傳 Presence 目前的狀態，例如「Weichung 在附近」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在 Mac 打開 Presence，到「手機與手錶」按「配對新的 iPhone」": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On your Mac, open Presence, go to Phone & Watch, and click Pair New iPhone"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Mac 打開 Presence，到「手機與手錶」按「配對新的 iPhone」"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在指定的時間內，電腦不會自動鎖定也不會自動解鎖。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For the given time, your computer won't lock or unlock automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在指定的時間內，電腦不會自動鎖定也不會自動解鎖。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "完成": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Done"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已連線": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connected"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已連線"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "從 iPhone 和 Apple Watch 鎖定你的 Mac、暫停或恢復 Presence，Mac 鎖定時也會通知你。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lock your Mac and pause or resume Presence from your iPhone and Apple Watch, and get notified when your Mac locks."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "從 iPhone 和 Apple Watch 鎖定你的 Mac、暫停或恢復 Presence，Mac 鎖定時也會通知你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "恢復": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Resume"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢復"
          }
        }
